missing or damaged shingles\n- Significant leaks or water damage\n- Visible sagging or structural issues\n- Granules from shingles collecting in gutters\n- High energy bills due to poor roof performance\n- Mold or moss growth on large roof sections\n\nDon't wait until a small issue becomes a major problem. Contact Home Evolution Contractor today for a professional roof assessment and discover how our replacement services can protect and beautify your home for decades to come. 📞✨",
